<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tracor Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tracor Inc raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its rating on Tracor Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 1/8 at 19-7/8.</p>
</text>
